---
manual: art.stroke
lines: [1835, 1837]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $blue = blue
  $red = red
  stroke $blue
  @before = oval 0, 0, 10
  stroke $red
  @after = oval 20, 0, 10
end
----------- test code
assert_equal $red, oval("@after").stroke, "a shape drawn after stroke carries that line colour"
assert_equal $blue, oval("@before").stroke, "a shape drawn earlier keeps its own"
